data: {"id": "d7aaf7cad6a14380-thinking-parallel_evidence-1649", "run_id": "d7aaf7cad6a14380", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 实时证据采集与因果分析\n\n## 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n\n- **Pod**: `workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974`, **Namespace**: `aiops-case-03`\n- **UID**: `9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897`\n- **调度节点**: `node2`\n- **容器**: `app`\n- **当前状态**: 始终为 `ContainerCreating`，未发生过重启或状态变更。\n\n## 2. Metrics 证据 (Prometheus)\n\n- **`kube_pod_status_phase`**: Phase 为 `Pending` (值为 1)，`Running`、`Succeeded`、`Failed` 均为 0。确认 Pod 卡在调度后、容器启动前的阶段。\n- **`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`**: 等待原因为 `ContainerCreating` (值为 1)。直接反映了 kubelet 正在尝试拉取镜像或挂载卷。\n- **", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789051831303, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

